  <ScenTitle>Sandies and Jollies, 1968</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;IMG alt=http://i1283.photobucket.com/albums/a558/cf_dallas/skyraider-crop-resize2_zpshuqilarv.jpg align=middle src="http://i1283.photobucket.com/albums/a558/cf_dallas/skyraider-crop-resize2_zpshuqilarv.jpg"&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;March 1968&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;A US Marine Corps F-4 was shot down over southern North Vietnam and both crew members ejected.&amp;nbsp; A rescue mission is on standby at Da Nang Airbase.&amp;nbsp; Take command and pick up the downed aircrew!&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Total Units:&amp;nbsp; Approx. 40&lt;BR&gt;Scenario Time:&amp;nbsp; 3 hours&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
